{"ID":"20240226091907-x47gf07","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240226091907-x47gf07","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240226091907-x47gf07\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240226091941-jim3n40\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607114538-5hocksq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2000,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240226092118-n2ai719\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"053川芎（川穹、芎穷、芎藭）","type":"doc","updated":"20240806125420"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240712145727-gogr7eh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712145727-gogr7eh","updated":"20240712145727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、江西、湖南、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t为不规则结节状拳形团块，直径2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7cm。表面黄褐色，粗糙皱缩，有多数平行隆起的轮节，顶端有凹陷的类圆形茎痕，下侧及轮节上有多数小瘤状根痕。质坚实，不易折断，断面黄白色或灰黄色，散有黄棕色的油室，形成层呈波状环纹。气浓香，味苦、辛。稍有麻舌感，微回甜。饮片边缘不整齐，呈不规则的类蝴蝶形薄片。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t活血祛瘀；行气开郁；祛风止痛 。用于胸痹心痛，胸胁刺痛，跌扑肿痛，月经不调，经闭痛经，瘾瘕腹痛，头痛，风湿痹痛。\n【炙品】\t酒川芎：取川芎片用黄酒喷洒均匀，稍闷，置锅内炒至微焦为度，取出放凉 (每川芎片100斤，用黄酒12斤8两) 。\n【注解】\t“蝴蝶片”：川芎饮片的别称。药材川芎为不规则结节状团块，加工纵切成为饮片后，形状类似蝴蝶，故饮片称为“蝴蝶片”。"}]},{"ID":"20240712145727-awh6re2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712145727-awh6re2","updated":"20240712145727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206082811-b8zexo7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240712145727-rlrvvws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240712145727-rlrvvws","updated":"20240712145727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span"